USER[Customer]:::client
API(API Gateway):::service
ORDERS[Order Service]:::service
DB[(Orders Database)]:::storage
QUEUE(Message Queue):::async
WORKER[Worker]:::async
PAYMENTS[Payment Provider]:::external
METRICS[Metrics]:::external

USER -->|HTTPS| API
API ==>|Main request| ORDERS
ORDERS -->|Private| DB
ORDERS -.->|Publish event| QUEUE
QUEUE -.->|Consume event| WORKER
WORKER -->|Private| DB
ORDERS <-->|Payment API| PAYMENTS
API --o|Telemetry| METRICS
WORKER --x|Failure signal| METRICS
PAYMENTS ---|Shared contract| METRICS
